            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek 24.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen Jedekia ocako jemo woko i kom kabaka me Babilon. I mwaka me aboŋwen me locce, i dwe me apar, i nino dwe apar, en aye Nebukadnejar kabaka me Babilon obino kwede ki monnye ducu i kom Jerucalem, ci orumo gaŋ woko, ka dok gutoro cel lobo orumo woko dyere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaŋ girumo kit meno nio wa i mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa kabaka Jedekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kom nino dwe aboŋwen me dwe me aŋwen onoŋo kec odoko marac i Jerucalem, ma omiyo cam pe dok nen pi lwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.33.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek 33.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gumuko cel me gaŋ woko, ci kabaka ki lwak lulweny ducu gumol gurmo woko ki i dyewor, kun giwok ki i dog gaŋ ma i kin cel aryo me Jerucalem, ma i ŋet poto pa kabaka, kadi onoŋo jo Kaldaya gurumo gaŋ woko. Gucito gulubo yo ma dok tuŋ Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento mony pa jo kaldaya guryemo kor kabaka, ci gumake wa i bar me Jeriko; ci monnye guket woko ducu ki i kome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gumako kabaka, ci gukelo en bot kabaka me Babilon i Ribla, ka ma onolle iye kop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek 12.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gucako neko awobe pa Jedekia woko ki i nyime ma wane neno, ka gikolo wane giloyo woko, ka gitweye ki nyor, gitere kwede wa i Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dwe me abic, i kom nino dwe me abirone, ma en aye mwaka me aboŋwenne me loc pa kabaka Nebukadnejar kabaka me Babilon, en aye Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok kabaka, ma latic pa kabaka me Babilon, obino i Jerucalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocako wano ot pa Rwot woko, ki ot pa kabaka, ki odi ducu ma tye i Jerucalem; owaŋo odi madito woko ducu ki mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki mony pa jo Kaldaya ducu, ma yam gitye kacel ki ladit pa lugwok kabaka, gumuko kicika cel murumo Jerucalem woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki lwak ma yam gudoŋ i gaŋ, ki jo ma yam gukobo gigi kengi bot kabaka me Babilon, kacel ki lwak ma gudoŋŋe ducu, Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok kabaka oterogi woko i opii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento owe ko lucan mogo gudoŋ i lobo wek gubed lugwok poto olok ki lupur ki kweri dyaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
