            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21+1KI.7.22+1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 7.15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.15+2CH.3.16+2CH.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 3.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki wir mola aryo ma yam gitye i ot pa Rwot, ki litino gadigadi ki nam me mola ma yam gitye i ot pa Rwot, jo Kaldaya guturo, guŋido woko ka gutero molane wa i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 7.45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 4.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutero lwak agulu ducu, ki akwaya latokke-gu, ki magac-gu ki atabo me odok eceta, ki jami mola ducu ma yam gitiyo kwedgi i ot pa Rwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki weer me waŋo mac bene, ki becen-gu. Gin ma yam gitiyo ki jabu, ladit pa lugwok kabaka otero macalo jabu, gin ma yam gitiyo ki ryal, otero macalo ryal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok ma dok i kom wir aryo-ni, ki nam acel, ki litino gadigadi ducu, ma yam Solomon otiyo pi ot pa Rwot, pek me mola ma oa ki i kom jami magi ducu dwoŋ, pe pimme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bor pa wir acel romo futi pyeraryo wiye abiro. I wiye yam giketo iye lalukana me mola, kun lalukana borre romo futi aŋwen ki nucu. I kom lalukana onoŋo giketo iye obwo ki cal nyig okwer pomegranat, ma gin ducu gitiyogi ki mola, ma girumo lalukana dyere. Wir me aryo bene rom ki lawote, kun tye ki obwone me mola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladit pa lugwok kabaka otero Ceraya bene ma ajwaka madit, ki Jepania, ajwaka me aryone, ki lukurdoggola me ot pa Rwot gin adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok okwanyo ladit ma loyo lumony ki i dye gaŋ, ki lumemba abic me lukiko pa kabaka ma onoŋogi i dye gaŋ; ki karan pa ladit me mony ma yam coko jo me lobo pi lweny, ki jo pyerabic i kin wegi lobo ma ginonogi i dye gaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebujaradan ladit pa lugwok kabaka omakogi, oterogi wa i Ribla bot kabaka me Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka me Babilon ocako nekogi woko ducu; onekogi i Ribla ma i lobo Kamat. Jo Juda yam gikwanyogi woko ki i lobogi giterogi i opii kit meno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadnejar kabaka me Babilon oketo Gedalia wod pa Akikam ma wod pa Capan me loyo jo mudoŋ i lobo Juda, ma yam owekogi gubwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ludito me mony ducu ma i kin gaŋi guwinyo ni kabaka me Babilon otyeko keto Gedalia me bedo laloyo, ci gubino ki lwakgi bot Gedalia wa i Mijpa. Nyiŋgi ene: Icmael wod pa Netania, Yokanan wod pa Karea, Ceraya wod pa Tankumet ma jo Netopa, ki Jajania wod pa jo Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia ocako kwoŋo kwoŋ botgi ki bot lwakgi ducu kun wacci, “Pe wulwor ludito tic pa jo Kaldaya. Wubed i lobo, wuti bot kabaka me Babilon, ci wubibedo maber laboŋo ayela mo,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i dwe me abiro, Icmael wod pa Netania, wod pa Elicama, ma tye i kaka pa luker, obino kacel ki jo apar, ci gulwenyo ki Gedalia, guneko woko, kacel ki Lujudaya ki jo Kaldaya ma gitye kwede i Mijpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 43.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen lwak ducu, jo matino ki jo madito, ki ludito me mony gua gucito wa i Ejipt, pien gulworo jo Kaldaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare me mwaka pyeradek wiye abirone nia ma gitero kwede Yekoyakin kabaka me Juda i opii, i dwe me apar wiye aryo, i kom nino dwe pyeraryo wiye abiro, en aye Evil-merodak, kabaka me Babilon, otimo kica ki Yekoyakin kabaka me Juda, ogonye woko ki i mabuc, i mwaka ma en ocamo iye ker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo ka lok kwede mot maber, oketo en obedo i kom madit makato ducu ma i kin kom pa luker ma onoŋo gibedo kwede i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno omiyo Yekoyakin olunyo boŋo mabuc mere woko, obedo ka cam i wi meja pa kabaka jwijwi, pi kare me kwone ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi miye gin me konye kwede, kabaka dok obedo ka miye lim me tic kwede jwijwi, nino ducu me kwo mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
